    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, there is no \"current version\" worth being. it's just a shell. if i keep going like this, i'm just going to become a parody of myself. i'd honestly rather just stop now while i'm still \"something\" than live to see myself become a total joke.",
